sc.quest.stone_essence_crystal.body1=§oNeeds a little "enchantment"§r
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword.title=Not So "Ultimate" Ultimate Stone Sword
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword.body=Craft a sword with Level 5 Compressed Cobblestone, then strengthen it on the stone crafting table with Stone Star and Level 5 Compressed Cobblestone
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword.body1=§oNow you have consumed endless cobblestones and finally obtained this sharp blade§r
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword.body2=§o"Is this the end?§r
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword.body3=§o"What, it can be strengthened further?§"§r
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_2.title=Never Outdated
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_2.body=On the Stone Crafting Table, upgrade the Ultimate Stone Sword with Stone Star and Level 5 Compressed Stone!
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_2.body1=§oActually, this is not the end§r
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_3.title=True "Ultimate"
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_3.body=On the Stone Crafting Table, upgrade the Ultimate Stone Sword ACT2 with Stone Star and Level 5 Compressed Stone!
sc.quest.uc_stone_sword_3.body1=§oI'm ridiculously strong§r
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.title=Stone Smithing Table
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.body=Use the Stone Smithing Table to add effects to the Ultimate Stone Sword!
sc.quest.stone_smithing_table.body1=§oWhy do you have a custom model?§r
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.title=Inlaid Essence Bead
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.body=Craft Inlaid Essence Beads in a crafting table, then combine with other items to grant attributes. Use the Stone Smithing Table to upgrade your tools!
sc.quest.inlaid_essence_bead.body1=§oLet me check the recipe§r
sc.quest.expansion_slab.title=Expansion Slab
sc.quest.expansion_slab.body=At a high cost, gives your tools more forging opportunities.
sc.quest.expansion_slab.body1=§oDon't skimp on those compressed stones in your inventory§r
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.title=Sacrificial Blade
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.body=Find the Sacrificial Blade within the Ancient Stone Altar.
sc.quest.sacrificial_blade.body1=§o"This sacred vessel has proven its worth in your hands. Sacrius, ascend."§r
sc.quest.blood_bottle.title=Blood Bottle
sc.quest.blood_bottle.body=While holding a glass bottle, use the Sacrificial Blade to obtain a Blood Bottle.
sc.quest.blood_bottle.body1=§o"Behold, citizens! This is the sacred blood spoken of by Falsus Magus — flowing within such a lowly being!"§r
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.title=Ersatz Blood Vial
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.body=Craft an Ersatz Blood Vial from a Blood Bottle in a crafting table.
sc.quest.ersatz_blood_vial.body1=§o"Falsus Magus! You promised me! Then why is this blood impure?!"§r
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.title=Blood Offering Vial
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.body=Place the Ersatz Blood Vial in a brewing stand and purify it using a Stone Heart.
sc.quest.blood_offering_vial.body1=§oNo one answered. Sacrius swayed in the wind, as destiny pointed toward a clear and terrifying path.§r
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.title=Activated Blood Sacrifice Pillar
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.body=Pour the Blood Offering Vial into the Blood Sacrifice Pillar at the center of the Ancient Stone Altar, then mine it.
sc.quest.stone_summoner_activated.body1=§o"Falsus Magus has deceived us! This is no herald of salvation — it is the prologue of calamity!"§r

sc.quest.stoneguard.title=Stone Guard
sc.quest.stoneguard.body=§oHard exterior, silent danger§r
sc.quest.stoneguard.body1=Basic hostile mob that spawns in the Overworld, applies slowness on attack.
sc.quest.stone_shooter.title=Stone Archer
sc.quest.stone_shooter.body=§oThis guy is really annoying...§r
sc.quest.stone_shooter.body1=Basic hostile mob that spawns in the Overworld, shoots arrows and applies slowness.
sc.quest.stone_vendor.title=Stone Wandering Trader
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body=§oNot a scammer! We're saved!§r
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body1=Normally trades peacefully with players. But if you hit first, it will fight back.
sc.quest.stone_vendor.body2=What? You even have to kill him to complete the quest?!
sc.quest.wandering_collector.title=Wandering Collector
sc.quest.wandering_collector.body=§oWandering... who are you?!§r
sc.quest.wandering_collector.body1=Friendly mobs that trade with players, some have unique trade tables, and know how to defend themselves.
sc.quest.wandering_collector.body2=You wouldn't kill him, would you?
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.title=Stone Vagabond
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.body=§oYou've awakened the Stone Vagabond§r
sc.quest.stone_vagabond.body1=Spawns only in Stone Wastelands. Tries to flee from players, but if provoked, shows its hidden side...
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.title=Molten Stone Guard
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.body=§oBurned by fire, though fragile, it never gives up hunting its prey§r
sc.quest.molten_stone_guard.body1=Spawns in the Nether, or transforms from Stone Guard in fire/lava. Has lower health but higher speed and attack.
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.title=Molten Stone Archer
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.body=§oBurned by fire, though fragile, it never gives up hunting its prey (but this one is much squishier)§r
sc.quest.molten_stone_shooter.body1=Spawns in the Nether, or transforms from Stone Guard in fire/lava. Has lower health but higher speed.
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.title=Elder Stone Guard
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body=§oI woke up, one-shot§r
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body1=Spawns in the Nether, wielding a sharp sword, punishing every player who enters the Nether without armor.
sc.quest.elder_stone_guard.body2=Just kidding, even iron armor gets one-shot.
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.title=Molten Elder Stone Guard
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.body=§oCan it get any more sinister?§r
sc.quest.molten_elder_stone_guard.body1=After being burned by fire, the Elder Stone Guard gains a more powerful "body". Only appears when an Elder Stone Guard is burned or enters lava.
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.title=Mossy Stone Guard
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.body=§oThe most poisonous spot§r
sc.quest.mossy_stone_guard.body1=A deadly variant that spawns in swamps, inflicts poison on players.
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.title=Mossy Stone Archer
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.body=§oDon't give me that swamp skeleton nonsense!§r
sc.quest.mossy_stone_shooter.body1=A deadly variant that spawns in swamps, inflicts poison on players.
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.title=Deepslate Stone Guard
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.body=§oA mysterious threat from the deep§r
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_guard.body1=Tougher and more painful than Stone Guard.
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.title=Deepslate Stone Archer
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.body=§oEven dumber§r
sc.quest.deepslate_stone_shooter.body1=Tougher than Stone Archer, but not more painful.
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.title=Sandstone Guard
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.body=§oBeneath the yellow sand, it tells of a thousand years of resentment§r
sc.quest.sandstone_guard.body1=A Stone Guard that only appears in deserts, rumored to bring hunger.
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.title=Sandstone Archer
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.body=§oI looked, and behold a black horse.§r
sc.quest.sandstone_shooter.body1=A Stone Archer that only appears in deserts, rumored to bring hunger.
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.title=Stone Fissuring Husk
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.body=§oHow to defend against a zero-frame start?§r
sc.quest.stone_fissuring_husk.body1=A stone creature that spawns in Stone Wastelands. When damaged, it drops Stone Blocks, which will assist in attacking. Try getting close? BOOM!!!
sc.quest.stone_block.title=Stone Block
sc.quest.stone_block.body=§oSmall and cute, except for you and silverfish.§r
sc.quest.stone_block.body1=Maybe too much friction and not enough power? Stone Blocks will approach you in a stop-and-go manner and attack.
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.title=§o§l§p[Boss]§rStone Totem§r
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body=§oSource of ancient calamity§r
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body1=A special and powerful boss, summoned by two Level 5 Compressed Stones and an Activated Blood Sacrifice Pillar.
sc.quest.ancient_stone_totem.body2=It has two states. State 1 can only be damaged by any pickaxe. State 2 will cycle through four forms. Be well prepared.

